"I witnessed them drafting villagers into forced labor, working them to exhaustion, and then executing those who collapsed. Hardly conduct befitting a man in uniform, no?"

pt:
//【香奈枝】
<voice name='香奈枝' class='香奈枝' src='voice/ma02/0010150a03'>
